cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  If you use it in academic work, please also cite the associated paper
  (currently under review at Remote Sensing; see preferred-citation below).
type: software
title: OpenHeritage3D-VIS
abstract: >-
  A browser-based Potree viewer template for cultural heritage point clouds,
  extending base Potree with a classification brush tool, zone-based
  navigation, oriented-image panoramas, and point cloud download tooling.
authors:
